  "description": "YoloDotNet.ExecutionProvider.CoreML enables hardware-accelerated inference on macOS using Apple’s native Core ML framework.\n\nThis provider integrates ONNX Runtime’s CoreML execution backend, allowing models to run efficiently on Apple Silicon by leveraging system-level ML acceleration. No external runtimes, drivers, or SDKs are required beyond a supported version of macOS.\n\nDesigned for YoloDotNet’s modular, execution-provider-agnostic architecture, the CoreML provider integrates cleanly with the core library and exposes predictable, explicit inference behavior. It is well-suited for macOS applications that require fast, low-power, native inference using Apple’s ML stack without additional dependencies.",
