  "releaseNotes": "This release updates the internal execution provider architecture to align with YoloDotNet v4.1. Model parsing and validation are now handled exclusively by the YoloDotNet core library, simplifying execution provider implementations and ensuring consistent model handling across all backends. This execution provider requires YoloDotNet version 4.1.",
